-as with a store through reflection that is not followed: the value stored is one that reflection makes of a type chosen at run time, which may be the Concrete Type, and the variable it is stored into holds an interface. The store is recorded; the flooding pass reaches Get, which reads the variable: a no apart from reflection, with the exit status of a maybe.
-- args --
-as example.com/fx.CodeErr a.go:@f
-- stdout --
$WORK/a.go:19:12-15: example.com/fx.CodeErr in Error Set of example.com/fx.Get: no, apart from reflection
	not followed: example.com/fx.CodeErr reaches 1 reflective store whose destination is unknown or only partly followed:
		$WORK/a.go:17:16-54: in example.com/fx.store
